<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Q2 cocoa grind due for release next week.</title>
<headline>Dutch Q2 cocoa grind due for release next week.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch second quarter cocoa grind is expected to be released at the end of next week, trade sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>In the first quarter of the year the grind in the Netherlands rose 1.46 percent to 102,338 tonnes.</p>
<p>Trade sources said they were expecting a slight increase on last year's second quarter total of 90,724 tonnes.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
